# Go/Rust release status

MPK's supported source languages are Go and Rust. The canonical semantic
registry is revision 4, with Go fixed and Rust checked entries. The bundle
registry contains two frontend/toolchain pairs and three target tuples.

The new registry requires fresh native Linux release validation. Earlier
migration receipts describe their original releases and cannot certify the
new metadata. Run the root README's local release gates before publication.
Practical Go remains private and under development at GO-PRAC-T02-W01.

The deterministic metadata/evidence report is `release-report.json`.
Proof acceptance still requires canonical checked certificate bytes.
